  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 671.04 Paper Checks. Financial assistance payments shall be issued by method of paper check only when a nursing facility client chooses to receive PNA payments in this manner.\n\nSource. #8071, eff 4-23-04; ss by #10178, eff 8-24-12; ss by #13190, eff 4-20-21",
